          "text": "Right knee special tests"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "McMurray: mild medial discomfort, no click. Thessaly at 20°: mildly uncomfortable. Lachman and anterior/posterior drawer negative; varus/valgus stable."
